    "created_at": "2025-03-06T03:03:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-06T03:03:10Z",
    "body": "Maybe we could word it like \"The URL has a [special scheme](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#special-scheme) and and it is incorrectly using U+005C (\\\\) instead of U+002F (/).\" or \"The URL has a [special scheme](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#special-scheme) and it was followed by a U+005C (\\\\).\" and dropping the \"instead of U+002F (/)\" as you suggested. I am fine with editing the wording if it is causing confusion.",
